# runs as a player carrying at least one activated (angry) enderman head somewhere. a seen player can
# move their worn (angry) head into their inventory, where nothing would ever calm it again. revert
# every angry head in a carry slot to the calm texture. the helmet slot (armor.head) is intentionally
# excluded: it is legitimately angry while the wearer is being seen, and the eye pass keeps it in sync.
execute if items entity @s weapon.offhand minecraft:player_head[minecraft:profile~{properties:[{value:"eyJ0ZXh0dXJlcyI6eyJTS0lOIjp7InVybCI6Imh0dHA6Ly90ZXh0dXJlcy5taW5lY3JhZnQubmV0L3RleHR1cmUvMTIwYmFmMmVkN2YyMzI2ODAzMTY1YWQ4MDFmYzA1NmQwMDIyNDNiZThjY2YyZDg3ZWEyNmI5Yzc2ZGMzZmE2ZSJ9fX0="}]}] run item modify entity @s weapon.offhand ehead:head_calm
